\log _{4} x-\log _{x} 16&=\frac{7}{6}-\log _{x} 8 \\
\frac{1}{2} \log _{x} 2 - 4 \log _{x} 2 &= \frac{7}{6} - 3 \log _{x} 2 \\
-\frac{7}{2} \log _{x} 2 &= \frac{7}{6} \\
\log _{x} 2 &= -\frac{2}{3}
\end{align*}

